<title>BELGIUM: BBL TO LOWER INVESTMENT CREDIT RATES.</title>
<headline>BBL TO LOWER INVESTMENT CREDIT RATES.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian Banque Bruxelles</p>
<p>Lambert (BBL) said it would cut its credit investment rates from</p>
<p>April 28 as follows:</p>
<p>    MATURITY		     NEW RATE	    CHANGE</p>
<p>    three-year revisable     5.70 pct	    -25 bps</p>
<p>    five-year revisable	6.50 pct	    -20 bps</p>
<p>    10-year fixed		7.55 pct	    -20 bps </p>
<p>NOTE: - The announcement follows a similar move by Belgian</p>
<p>investment credit bank NMKN-SNCI.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
